---
---
<section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decorative Spacial UI Elements -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[40rem] h-[40rem] bg-secundario/30 rounded-full blur-[100px] -z-10 mix-blend-multiply opacity-60 translate-x-1/3 -translate-y-1/3"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[35rem] h-[35rem] bg-principal/20 rounded-full blur-[80px] -z-10 mix-blend-multiply opacity-60 -translate-x-1/4 translate-y-1/4"></div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-10 relative z-10">
    <!-- Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-[1px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-principal/40 to-secundario/40 shadow-sm mb-2">
      <span class="px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md text-sm font-semibold text-contraste/90 inline-block">
        ✨ Nueva Colección 2024
      </span>
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-contraste leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
      Invitaciones digitales que <br class="hidden sm:block"/>
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-principal to-[#6A8768]">
        inspiran emociones
      </span>
    </h1>
    
    <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl text-contraste/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
      Diseños exclusivos, ecológicos y con entrega inmediata para que tu evento comience de la mejor manera.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-6">
      <a href="#diseños" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-principal text-white font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-principal/90 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(139,168,136,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgb(139,168,136,0.5)] hover:-translate-y-1">
        Descubre nuestros diseños
      </a>
      <a href="#saber-mas" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-lg border border-white/60 text-contraste font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-white/60 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1">
        Saber más
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
